<title>BELGIUM: SIOEN INVESTS 420 MLN BFR IN NEW MACHINE.</title>
<headline>SIOEN INVESTS 420 MLN BFR IN NEW MACHINE.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian textile firm Sioen Industries SA said in a statement on Friday it planned to invest 420 million Belgian francs in a new weaving machine.</p>
<p>&quot;The unit will be built in Mouscron and should be operational from the spring of 1998,&quot; Sioen said.</p>
<p>Sioen added it would release full-year 1996 results on April 26.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
